  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operation of Semi-Independent Living Units for Unaccompanied Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to contribute to the provision of rights-based protection, comprehensive and inclusive support to unaccompanied migrant children (UMCs) in Cyprus. The project will facilitate the transition of 50 UMCs out of current living spaces into a more sustainable, community embedded model of care &#x2013; semi-independent living units, while focusing on fostering their life-skills, access to health, psychosocial support, education, and extra-curricular activities.</narrative>
  </description>
